concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-1-sec-8a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8A Workplace environment that is hostile for 2 or more reasons"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8a ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Act, a workplace environment may be offensive, intimidating or humiliating to a person by reason of:  (a) the sex of the person; or  (b) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of the sex of the person; or  (c) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of the sex of the person; if it is offensive, intimidating or humiliating by reason of 2 or more matters that include the sex or the characteristic, whether or not the sex or the characteristic is the dominant or substantial reason.  Hostile workplace environments  Schedule 1  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022" ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Act, a workplace environment may be offensive, intimidating or humiliating to a person by reason of:  (a) the sex of the person; or  (b) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of the sex of the person; or  (c) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of the sex of the person; if it is offensive, intimidating or humiliating by reason of 2 or more matters that include the sex or the characteristic, whether or not the sex or the characteristic is the dominant or substantial reason.  Hostile workplace environments  Schedule 1  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7a1b1b5a8bad72605014f49c6f169a814b48167defba28f5c5fb497f8a148fb6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Workplace environment must not be hostile for 2 or more reasons" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf> ;
