    cof:title "8A Workplace environment that is hostile for 2 or more reasons" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Act, a workplace environment may be offensive, intimidating or humiliating to a person by reason of:  (a) the sex of the person; or  (b) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of the sex of the person; or  (c) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of the sex of the person; if it is offensive, intimidating or humiliating by reason of 2 or more matters that include the sex or the characteristic, whether or not the sex or the characteristic is the dominant or substantial reason.  Hostile workplace environments  Schedule 1  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

