    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-28m-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this section: conduct includes making a statement, whether the statement is made orally or in writing.  Schedule 1  Hostile workplace environments  Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022 No. 85, 2022" ;
    skos:definition "(4) In this section: conduct includes making a statement, whether the statement is made orally or in writing.  Schedule 1  Hostile workplace environments  Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022 No. 85, 2022"@en ;
