concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35A Functions of Commission relating to positive duty in relation to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-35a ;
    values:originalText "sex discrimination  The following functions are conferred on the Commission:  (a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission considers appropriate, guidelines for complying with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public discussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  Schedule 2  Positive duty" ;
    skos:definition "sex discrimination  The following functions are conferred on the Commission:  (a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission considers appropriate, guidelines for complying with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public discussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  Schedule 2  Positive duty"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e012b9759821fecb36c89976a2caa58a9beb32cbab33c92b4d9214b172015456" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commission's functions related to positive duty in relation to sex discrimination" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf> ;
