doc:sch-2-sec-35a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "35A Functions of Commission relating to positive duty in relation to" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "sex discrimination  The following functions are conferred on the Commission:  (a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission considers appropriate, guidelines for complying with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public discussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  (c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;  Schedule 2  Positive duty" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35AA Performance of functions relating to positive duty in relation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-35aa ;
    values:originalText "to sex discrimination  In performing its functions under section 35A, the Commission must have regard to:  (a) the need for guidelines and other materials to be available in multiple languages; and  (b) the cultural diversity of Australian workplaces." ;
    skos:definition "to sex discrimination  In performing its functions under section 35A, the Commission must have regard to:  (a) the need for guidelines and other materials to be available in multiple languages; and  (b) the cultural diversity of Australian workplaces."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6b5b9cf89d842a8767184cb65a1799dc61fe65567628bd5b0673ccce51ccaa0d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commission must have regard to guidelines and cultural diversity in performing its functions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
