concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 After subsection 11(3)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (3A) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(da), the functions of the Commission do not include inquiring into an intelligence agency’s compliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination.  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (3B) If the President reasonably suspects that an intelligence agency is not complying with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination, the President must refer the matter to the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (3A) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(da), the functions of the Commission do not include inquiring into an intelligence agency’s compliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination.  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (3B) If the President reasonably suspects that an intelligence agency is not complying with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination, the President must refer the matter to the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
