concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35g-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35G(8) Reconsideration of compliance notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-35g-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If the President’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the President, the delegate who reconsiders a compliance notice:  (a) must not have been involved in giving the compliance notice; and  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same level as the person who gave the compliance notice." ;
    skos:definition "(8) If the President’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the President, the delegate who reconsiders a compliance notice:  (a) must not have been involved in giving the compliance notice; and  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same level as the person who gave the compliance notice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bcf9b1151d54063a5148ba384fac40ae661af75af248139721fcfd568fa61c79" ;
    values:partOf concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35g ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegate must not have been involved in giving the compliance notice and hold a position of at least the same level as the person who gave the notice." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
