doc:sch-2-sec-35k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "35K(2) Enforceable undertakings" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, the President is an authorised person in relation to section 47C of the Sex Discrimination Act 1984." ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35k-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35K(3) Enforceable undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-35k-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The President may, in writing, delegate the President’s powers and functions under Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act in relation to section 47C of the Sex Discrimination Act 1984 to a member of the staff of the Commission who is:  (a) an SES employee; or  (b) an acting SES employee; or  (c) classified as Executive Level 2 or equivalent; or  (d) acting in a position usually occupied by a member of the staff of the Commission who is so classified. Note: The expressions SES employee and acting SES employee are defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  Relevant court" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The President may, in writing, delegate the President’s powers and functions under Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act in relation to section 47C of the Sex Discrimination Act 1984 to a member of the staff of the Commission who is:  (a) an SES employee; or  (b) an acting SES employee; or  (c) classified as Executive Level 2 or equivalent; or  (d) acting in a position usually occupied by a member of the staff of the Commission who is so classified. Note: The expressions SES employee and acting SES employee are defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Positive duty  Schedule 2 Compliance  Part 2  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  Relevant court"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9705ac2699e6530fac79cb04977de5079165bc049a6184ba2858355b43a1dcfb" ;
    values:partOf concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35k ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of powers and functions to a staff member" ;
