concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35k-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35K(4) Enforceable undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-35k-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to section 47C of the Sex Discrimination Act 1984:  (a) the Federal Court;  (b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2). Enforceable undertaking may be published on the Commission’s website" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to section 47C of the Sex Discrimination Act 1984:  (a) the Federal Court;  (b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2). Enforceable undertaking may be published on the Commission’s website"@en ;
