concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35L Functions of Commission relating to systemic discrimination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-35l ;
    values:originalText "(1) The following functions are conferred on the Commission:  (a) to inquire into any matter that may relate to systemic unlawful discrimination or suspected systemic unlawful discrimination;  (b) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of any of the preceding functions.  (2) In this Act: systemic unlawful discrimination means unlawful discrimination that:  (a) affects a class or group of persons; and  (b) is continuous, repetitive or forms a pattern." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The following functions are conferred on the Commission:  (a) to inquire into any matter that may relate to systemic unlawful discrimination or suspected systemic unlawful discrimination;  (b) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of any of the preceding functions.  (2) In this Act: systemic unlawful discrimination means unlawful discrimination that:  (a) affects a class or group of persons; and  (b) is continuous, repetitive or forms a pattern."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8d6cac636c92d67500817b4c5840d25f93a1202d45ed9e78bd0dcb6edb0854d7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
