concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-4-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 After subsection 46PO(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (4A) In the case of a representative application, subsection (4) applies as if a reference to an applicant included a reference to a person on whose behalf the application is made, other than one who has opted out under subsection 46POB(3)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (4A) In the case of a representative application, subsection (4) applies as if a reference to an applicant included a reference to a person on whose behalf the application is made, other than one who has opted out under subsection 46POB(3)."@en ;
