concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-4-sec-8-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(5) After section 46PO"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-8-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Except with the leave of the court concerned, the hearing of the proceeding must not commence earlier than the date before which a person may opt out of the proceeding. Settlement and discontinuance" ;
