concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-4-sec-8-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(7) After section 46PO"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-8-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the court concerned gives such an approval, it may make such orders as are just with respect to the distribution of any money paid under a settlement or paid into the court.  Representative applications  Schedule 4  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022" ;
    skos:definition "(7) If the court concerned gives such an approval, it may make such orders as are just with respect to the distribution of any money paid under a settlement or paid into the court.  Representative applications  Schedule 4  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d8d49bff23cec74c71e81104a9124cd252ec77c377f114cfa7d8ae80070c0fd0" ;
    values:partOf concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-4-sec-8 ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may make orders regarding distribution of money paid under a settlement or into court." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
