concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-4-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the amendments of Division 2 of Part IIB of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986 made by this Schedule, that Division continues to apply, as if those amendments had not been made, in relation to:  (a) any complaint that was terminated under Division 1 of Part IIB of that Act before the commencement of this item; and  (b) any application made under subsection 46PO(1) of that Act, whether before or after that commencement, if the complaint on which the application is based was terminated under Division 1 of Part IIB of that Act before that commencement.  Schedule 6  Amendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022 No. 85, 2022" ;
    skos:definition "Despite the amendments of Division 2 of Part IIB of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986 made by this Schedule, that Division continues to apply, as if those amendments had not been made, in relation to:  (a) any complaint that was terminated under Division 1 of Part IIB of that Act before the commencement of this item; and  (b) any application made under subsection 46PO(1) of that Act, whether before or after that commencement, if the complaint on which the application is based was terminated under Division 1 of Part IIB of that Act before that commencement.  Schedule 6  Amendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022 No. 85, 2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "281064edf54b116fd11e0c6cd36b43e05646d61a9d190789bfe5d5070652f167" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Continues to apply Division 1 of Part IIB of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986 in relation to certain complaints and applications." ;
