    skos:prefLabel "5B Binding the Crown"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-5b ;
    values:originalText "This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth. However, it does not bind the Crown in right of a State, of the Australian Capital Territory or of the Northern Territory." ;
