concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-6-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 After subsection 13(3)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Exclusion of operationally sensitive information etc.  (3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law enforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).  (3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report any information:  Amendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the meaning of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010); or  (b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence or international relations of Australia." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Exclusion of operationally sensitive information etc.  (3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law enforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).  (3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report any information:  Amendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6  No. 85, 2022 Anti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment (Respect at Work) Act 2022  (a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the meaning of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010); or  (b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence or international relations of Australia."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fea06cedb5f139aa8dc0ceacb0a9b5e8c0b872afe9bd44ee96069228fd5ce393" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
